{"product_id":"business-the-speed-of-thought-using-a-digital-nervous-system","title":"Business @ The Speed Of Thought Using A Digital Nervous System","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn his new book, Microsoft chairman and CEO Bill Gates discusses how technology can help run businesses better today and how it will transform the nature of business in the near future. Gates stresses the need for managers to view technology not as overhead but as a strategic asset, and offers detailed examples from Microsoft, GM, Dell, and many other successful companies. Companion Web site.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Bill Gates with Collins Hemingway\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780140283112\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003ePages: 496\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 170 x 250\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750489956505,"sku":"2RA9780140283112","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/business-at-the-speed-of-thought-using-a-digital-nervous-system-395827.jpg?v=1694789835","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/business-the-speed-of-thought-using-a-digital-nervous-system","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}